,{"id":5369,"name":"guard"},{"id":5424,"name":"women's prison"},{"id":9748,"name":"revenge"},{"id":184352,"name":"rape and revenge"}],"releaseDates":[{"iso_3166_1":"JP","release_dates":[{"certification":"","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"1972-08-25T00:00:00.000Z","type":3}]}],"translations":[{"iso_639_1":"fr","iso_3166_1":"FR","name":"Français","english_name":"French","title":"La Femme Scorpion","overview":"Après avoir été trahie par l'homme qu'elle aimait, Matsu, surnommée Sasori, va tout faire pour s'évader de prison et assouvir sa vengeance.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"en","iso_3166_1":"US","name":"English","english_name":"English","title":"Female Prisoner #701: Scorpion","overview":"After being cruelly set up and deceived by Sugimi, a detective in cahoots with the mob with whom she was whole-heartedly in love, Matsushima’s desire for revenge knows no bounds.","tagline":"A woman betrayed and imprisoned. A mission of vengeance."},{"iso_639_1":"nl","iso_3166_1":"NL","name":"Nederlands","english_name":"Dutch","title":"Joshuu 701-gô: Sasori","overview":"Nima Matsushima wordt gevangene 701 in een vrouwenbajes nadat ze haar ex-minnaar, een undercover agent die haar oplichtte, met een mes aanviel. Matsu is vastberaden wraak te nemen, maar dan moet ze eerst ontsnappen uit de gevangenis, waar ze niet geliefd is en iedereen getergd is haar te breken.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ru","iso_3166_1":"RU","name":"Pусский","english_name":"Russian","title":"Заключенная №701: Скорпион","overview":"Воспользовавшись юностью и наивностью Мацу, инспектор антинаркотического отдела Сугими влюбляет ее в себя, а затем подставляет, отправив в логово наркодельцов. Схватив преступников, он бросает Мацу. Предприняв неудачную попытку мести, она садится в тюрьму. Теперь ее единственное желание выйти и отомстить негодяю.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"de","iso_3166_1":"DE","name":"Deutsch","english_name":"German","title":"Sasori – Scorpion","overview":"Betrogen zu werden ist das Verbrechen einer Frau: Gefangene # 701, Nami Matsushima, sitzt nach dem Verrat durch ihren Geliebten, dem Polizeioffizier Sugimi, in einem der härtesten Zuchthäuser Japans. Gedemütigt von selbstgerechten Aufsehern, gequält von sadistischen Insassinnen wird Nami zu Sasori, dem Skorpion, der scheinbar alles duldet, um dann plötzlich seinen tödlichen Stachel zu zeigen. Die Härte in ihren Augen macht selbst den abgebrühtesten Wärtern Angst. Zeit, sie endgültig loszuwerden.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"it","iso_3166_1":"IT","name":"Italiano","english_name":"Italian","title":"Female Prisoner #701: Scorpion","overview":"Nami Matsushima è stata tradita dal suo amante Sugimi, un poliziotto che l'ha fatta stuprare da un gruppo di yakuza. In seguito al fallito tentativo di uccidere Sugimi, Nami è stata rinchiusa in un carcere gestito da un sadico uomo. Lì tenta la fuga insieme alla sua amica Yuriko","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"es","iso_3166_1":"ES","name":"Español","english_name":"Spanish","title":"Female Prisoner #701: Scorpion","overview":"Nami Matsuhima es una mujer que se enamora completamente de Sumigi, un policía corrupto. Sugimi buscando ascender en su carrera, convence a Nami para que se infiltre en un clan yakuza que quiere detener. Tras lograr su objetivo, Sugimi se olvida de ella, que se siente traicionada e intenta asesinarle. Como consecuencia, Matsu acaba en la cárcel, donde sufrirá todo tipo de torturas y abusos por parte de los guardias y prisioneras, mientras trata de escaparse para poder completar su venganza. Primera entrega de la saga Sasori.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ko","iso_3166_1":"KR","name":"한국어/조선말","english_name":"Korean","title":"여죄수 사소리","overview":"배신한 연인을 살해하고 감옥에 들어간 사소리는 강간과 린치 등 지옥과도 같은 고통을 겪게 된다. 참고 참았지만 결국 사소리는 자신을 지옥으로 내몬 남자들을 향한 복수의 길을 택하게 된다. 만화를 원작으로 한 《여죄수 사소리》는 이후 《수라설희》 등 '여성의 잔혹한 복수‘를 다룬 영화에 큰 영향을 주었다. 주연을 맡은 카지 메이코의 스타일리시한 연기가 일품. (2017년 제21회 부천국제판타스틱영화제)","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"CN","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"女囚701：蝎子","overview":"　　女主角被贪污刑警爱人陷害后，想杀死贪污刑警未遂入狱。在牢中，女主角曾尝试越狱，但失手被抓，连累狱中同囚被狱警无理欺压。贪污刑警雇用监狱中女囚，企图暗中杀人灭口，但未能得手。其後，囚犯因不能忍受狱警的无理虐待，触发暴动。女主角成功趁乱逃狱後，化身黑衣复仇天使，亲手手刃仇人及相关人员。","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"eo","iso_3166_1":"EO","name":"Esperanto","english_name":"Esperanto","title":"Prizonulino 701: Skorpio","overview":"Kruele enkaptigita per malrekta detektivo Sugimi (Isao Natsuyagi), kiun ŝi amis, Nami “la Skorpio” Matsuŝima (Meiko Kaji) estas kondamnita al malmolan tempon en virinmalliberejo, kiu estas administrita per sadisma kaj seksavida gardistoj. Estas 700 aliaj malliberuloj, farante Matsu numero 701. Ŝia krimo estis malsukcesa provo ponardi Sugimi sur la ŝtupoj de la Tokia Metropola Policĉefstabejo ĉar li uzis ŝin por akiri favoron kun la jakuzo. Dum en malliberejo ŝi renkontas malliberigitojn kiel Yuki Kida (Yayoi Watanabe) fraŭdisto kaj ŝtelisto, Otsuka (Akemi Negishi), rompoŝtelisto kaj ĉantaĝisto, kaj Katagiri (Rie Yokoyama) kiu estis malliberigita pro krimfajro kaj kontraŭleĝe forigado de korpo.","tagline":"Virino, perfidita kaj enprizonigita. Misio de venĝado."},{"iso_639_1":"cs","iso_3166_1":"CZ","name":"Český","english_name":"Czech","title":"Džošú 701gó: Sasori","overview":"","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"pl","iso_3166_1":"PL","name":"Polski","english_name":"Polish","title":"","overview":"Historia młodej dziewczyny, która oszukana przez swojego chłopaka zostaje zgwałcona. Chcac się na nim zemścić próbuje go zabić, przez co trafia do więzienia. Tam maltretowana psychicznie i fizycznie przez strażników i współwięźniarki, czeka na chwilę, w której będzie się mogła zemścić.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ja","iso_3166_1":"JP","name":"日本語","english_name":"Japanese","title":"女囚701号さそり","overview":"女子刑務所からの脱走を企てたナミと由紀子だったが、二人のもくろみは失敗に終わる。ナミは刑事の杉見と恋人同士だったが、麻薬のおとり捜査に使われた上、杉見に裏切られてしまった。ナミは復讐のため杉見を襲うが、逆に逮捕されてしまったのだ。ナミは刑務所で他の女囚から嫌われていたが、唯一、由紀子とだけは親しかった。ある日、刑務所で暴動が起こり、由紀子が射殺されてしまう。","tagline":"裁きは私が殺る!"},{"iso_639_1":"pt","iso_3166_1":"BR","name":"Português","english_name":"Portuguese","title":"Female Prisoner #701: Scorpion","overview":"","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"pt","iso_3166_1":"PT","name":"Português","english_name":"Portuguese","title":"Prisioneira #701: Escorpiã","overview":"Depois de ter sido usada e traída pelo detetive por quem se apaixonara, a jovem Matsu é enviada para uma prisão feminina cheia de guardas sádicas e prisioneiras desobedientes.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"HK","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"女囚 701 之一：蠍子","overview":"女主角被貪汙刑警愛人陷害後，想殺死貪汙刑警未遂入獄。在牢中，女主角曾嘗試越獄，但失手被抓，聯累獄中同囚被獄警無理欺壓。貪汙刑警僱傭監獄中女囚，企圖暗中殺人滅口，但未能得手。其後，囚犯因不能忍受獄警的無理虐待，觸發暴動。女主角成功趁亂逃獄後，化身黑衣復仇天使，親手手刃仇人及相關人員。","tagline":""}],"videos":[{"key":"5ceGRIWDRoA","site":"YouTube","type":"Trailer","name":"Original Trailer [Subtitled]","iso_639_1":"en","official":true,"published_at":"2016-08-02T08:56:48.000Z","size":1080}],"images":{"posters":[{"file_path":"/Q3A9Mow4kSC7xpoiaBTuCOaIRl.jpg","width":2000,"height":3000,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":6.722,"vote_count":9},{"file_path":"/6NjKOHmKnoBmjeOTRGsO5nE7uaF.jpg","width":662,"height":879,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":3.334,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/7j0Ak0l84SuzyUUnWIzNAMyMHXb.jpg","width":2000,"height":3000,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":1.75,"vote_count":2},{"file_path":"/jbLBJbDNw93g7RrWHz2oq0KddKY.jpg","width":810,"height":1092,"iso_639_1":"fr","vote_average":0.166,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/4j7Zv5syOE0dstUuUCGuy2Yvv9R.jpg","width":500,"height":750,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":0.166,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/7aJtuJAccYhtn5gIoxSbLMRCTch.jpg","width":1500,"height":2250,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"file_path":"/co5ohwxsnRXHCBxzMOuKSoLUHSK.jpg","width":1080,"height":1609,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"file_path":"/uxXDuzaeJo2VgNw56wBb54Oiz5r.jpg","width":960,"height":1371,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"file_path":"/um34dyw5Dnl1OQSad446jyRWByu.jpg","width":1084,"height":15